window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Fight or flight only works when you know who you're up against.</p> <p>There's no running from an enemy who is constantly several steps ahead. The best you can do is stand and face them.</p> <p>Finding my mate should have been a time to rejoice, not the catalyst for disaster. The closer we become, the more danger we find ourselves in.</p> <p>Shocking revelations and buried secrets surface, only reinforcing the truth that Griffin and I are in big trouble.</p> <p>One thing is clear, we can’t win if we don’t even know who we’re up against. I’m not quite sure if we’ll be able to make it out alive.</p> <p>If you can't get enough of books by Patricia Briggs, Ilona Andrews, Leia Stone, and Jaymin Eve, then you'll love this paranormal romance.</p> <p>Buy <i>Rising Darkness</i> today.</p>"; 
